              ]
            },
            {
              "or": [
                {
                  "exists": "/BG-7/BT-48"
                },
                {
                  "exists": "/BG-7/BT-47"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "message": "A document level charge or tax (BG-21) is categorised \"AE\" (reverse charge), and the invoice carries none of them: a seller VAT identifier (BT-31), a seller tax registration identifier (BT-32) or a seller tax representative VAT identifier (BT-63), and a buyer VAT identifier (BT-48) or a buyer legal registration identifier (BT-47).",
    "source": "EN 16931-1:2026, 6.4.3.4.6, Table 9, BR-AE-4",
    "note": "Against the 2017 edition the identifiers the rule asks for are the same; the group it is about now carries non-VAT taxes as well."
